    "title": "Amazon to Begin Work on $98M Terrell Distribution Center - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mike Boyd ,\n10 hours ago Amazon is constructing a new $98 million, 1.2 million-square-foot regional distribution center in Terrell, Texas. The Dallas Morning News reports construction could begin as early as August 2026, with completion slated for next year. Amazon bought the 120-acre development site last year from Hunt Realty Investments. Located at 3201 Airport... Read full article\n1",
